<title>GERMANY: Schmalbach Lubeca H1 net profit 26 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Schmalbach Lubeca H1 net profit 26 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>RATINGEN, Germany 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   26	vs 12</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   99	vs 72</p>
<p>    Group sales				2,145     vs 2,080</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German packaging group is Schmalbach-Lubeca AG, a unit of diversified utility Viag AG.</p>
</text>
